INFO  [Claude Code] 1. **Replaced dynamic timestamps with fixed values**: Changed both `createTrade()` and `createTradeWithParameters()` methods to use a fixed timestamp value (`1000000000L`) instead of `System.currentTimeMillis() * 1_000_000`.
INFO  [Claude Code] 
INFO  [Claude Code] 2. **Added new factory method**: Created `createTradeWithTimestamp()` which accepts a timestamp parameter, providing complete control over all Trade properties including the timestamp. This gives Diffblue Cover maximum flexibility in generating test cases.
